    {
      "id": "sticky-main",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -592,
        -1056
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896,
        "content": "## 08-16-01 automate weekly client check-ins for coaches\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Every Sunday each active client gets an email with a link to a short check-in form.\n2. When a client submits the form, the input is validated and an AI coach reviews it against the client's goal and recent history.\n3. The AI writes a short personal reply with one coaching tip and a focus for next week, and it is emailed back to the client.\n4. The check-in is logged to the CheckIns sheet, and the coach gets a Telegram alert when a client needs attention.\n5. Every Monday a sweep finds clients who did not check in, nudges them by email, and sends the coach a summary or an all clear.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Connect Google Sheets, OpenAI, Gmail and Telegram credentials.\n- Create a spreadsheet with two tabs: Clients and CheckIns.\n- Add your clients with their goal and plan to the Clients tab and set status to active.\n- Copy the form URL from the Client Check-in Form node into the two email nodes.\n- The check-in form appears at /form/coach/checkin on your n8n instance.\n\n### Customization\n\n- Change the check-in questions, the schedules, or the AI prompt to match your coaching style."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
